  "body": "Each step in the \"Resolving server names\" spec tells you to \"resolve the IP address using AAAA or A records\", which doesn't make it clear whether or not CNAME records are allowed.\r\n\r\nIf they're not allowed, Synapse should be fixed not to allow them.",
